==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features both the male and female forms of {{p|Frillish}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Plasma Storm|Frillish|38}} from the {{TCG|Plasma Storm}} expansion.
*{{m|Absorb}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that Frillish can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

